  "id": "yankee-pot-roast",
  "name": "Yankee Pot Roast",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered beef with vegetables and savory gravy",
  "description": "A tender stovetop beef roast braised with onions, carrots, celery, garlic, wine, and broth, then finished with a thickened pan gravy.",
